;; What this case exercises; edit by hand.  `bb corpus-accept' leaves it alone.
(:book "ANAYA_Gramatica_B1"
 :source "ANAYA_Gramatica_B1.pdf"
 :page 15
 :exercises "An exercise workbook's numbered lines staying prose.  The old
text-only synthesis promoted every short numbered exercise sentence -
532 of ANAYA's 620 promotions sat at body size - and 296 headings
folded to nothing.  The geometry synthesis promotes only the unit's
display labels: EJERCICIOS and Practique cómo se construye at their
cluster ranks, while the numbered exercises (1. Facciones →), the
circled exercise digits (display-size but letterless), and the answer
boxes all stay the prose they are.
 The licences below are not this unit's bug.  added, page-marker and
the mid-sentence budget name the two-column answer-table braid - the
gender-table lanes interleave by baseline, the spanish-gender-pairs
class, FW11's residual - and heading names EJERCICIOS folding empty
because Practique follows it at the same cluster rank with nothing
between: the adjacent-label residual the unit records."
 :budget (:mid-sentence 1)
 :tolerates (added page-marker heading))
